I used 'usermod -x administrative_lock_applied=3D0 informix' to unlock =
the
account, then I reset the password.  Other options are:

1)  Use a script with:
	usermod -x grace_limit=3D1 informix=20
	usermod -x administrative_lock_applied=3D0 informix
=09
2)  /usr/sbin/usermod -x passwd_lifetime=3D0 informix /usr/sbin/usermod =
-x
administrative_lock_applied=3D0  informix

